==Strategy==
Abuse the floating trait to its fullest. Bring [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sadako Cat]] for the Beefcake and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] as a general meatshield. The Those Guys and Squire Rels at the beginning should serve as decent money to feed into [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cats]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cats]].

